{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "99733c945109cf71e836ae3e7e8a57bed442f6508ae91ef66b05f00aef47b623", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\n新しい衣装を着てみたのですが……いかがですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我试着穿上了新服装……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "4053857197399b44d04bbda3e278c0aec5ceea3e202e7e8963446df0babde805", "ja": "ぶろぐでは、ファンの皆様からたくさん\nお褒めの言葉をいただいたのですが……。", "zh": "在博客上，收到了各位粉丝许多赞美之词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1121f455f43c5dd422495ef5163f81edc5b65e72074960ff39d58a23b263b7fd", "ja": "おっ、よかったじゃないか。\nみんなの言う通り、バッチリじゃないかな。", "zh": "哦，那不是挺好的吗？\n正如大家所说，做得非常棒吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "5317d36f403a2be922b6a6bf05a6b06986112d5196ce28a925b2cf70665660a8", "ja": "そうですか……。\nちなみに、どのようにばっちりなのですか？", "zh": "是吗……  \n顺便问一下，具体是怎样的完美呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a2a80d57d59c403e241b4c10baf5a10b0079c580fcbc3a3482a9b1d9adadc1e7", "ja": "えっ。どうって……\nだから、かわいい感じ？", "zh": "欸。怎么说呢……\n就是，可爱之类的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "28d4cd9e05def3dd326b1add13f43cf4b36102299d4da687f33f1432cb6bec23", "ja": "そうですか……。\nちなみに、どのようにかわいいのですか？", "zh": "这样啊……\n顺便问一下，具体是怎样的可爱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1006_p", "source_sha256": "358c5f2884e6a13cc00771c7c3bb5ad50bf47cc8d99bc044449e4a23c44272dd", "ja": "いや、どうしたんだ？\n新しい衣装、じつは気に入らないのか？", "zh": "不，怎么了吗？\n这套新服装，其实你并不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "f6e91461e2447d58f94545faae5f9660e359acd85abf779e4615cc20918766b0", "ja": "そうではありません！　ただ、なにやらまだ、\n気恥ずかしいのです……。", "zh": "不是这样的！只是，总觉得还是有些害羞……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "520787dd02a420c753e6a7464564902b4af820db492548bc022c3ae30a1d69ed", "ja": "恥ずかしいって……。でも、この衣装のデザインは\nたしか貴音の希望を取り入れたような……？", "zh": "难为情是……。不过，这套服装的设计\n我记得确实是采纳了贵音的希望吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "7333efe91be634a998637a4ee73553b5a285c565e5f1d47e57535d322666d731", "ja": "うう、いけずなことを仰らないでください……。\n確かに申し上げましたが、実際に着てみると……。", "zh": "呜呜，请不要故意为难我……\n我确实提过，但实际穿上之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "d3b88dc4c8421cccd6b95218a00403d5e5b08443ebadc39de47644bd65201b81", "ja": "鏡に映る自分の様子が、思った以上に\n日ごろと違うものですから。落ち着かないのです……。", "zh": "镜中映出的自己，比想象中\n和往日大不相同，让我有些不自在……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4d3b5c18614bc8baf6842206211e38208174208eed11dcefffc526501669fde5", "ja": "なるほど……でも、そのギャップがまたいいと思うな。\n普段の様子と違うからこそ、より引き立つ……。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，我觉得正是这种反差才更棒。正因为和平时不一样，才更能凸显出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "37fab35e5c128eab7d300424b48ad70df501b42d1828d1d4dfe8c86822058d69", "ja": "そう。ギャップ萌えといわれる現象だ。", "zh": "没错。这就是所谓的反差萌现象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "6bd2f87088d5841b31ea6545f2df0e5ded0a5d7f9977467e6709ca6e60c78ecb", "ja": "ぎゃっぷ萌え……！\nはて、何やら面妖な響きですね？", "zh": "反差萌……！\n嗯？这个词听起来还真有些奇怪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "af0957e4883357aee22ff33a52cfd64c049f53822afb2f203326f4294604bc06", "ja": "ああ、響きはちょっと面妖だが、\n現象の仕組みは論理的にまるで間違ってない。と思う。", "zh": "啊，听起来虽然有点怪异，\n但我想，这种现象的原理在逻辑上完全没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "93a93077289a497daa38a55ab10691ac040aa95fffbfe58763a4beb6fd47a9f0", "ja": "そうでしたか……。初耳でしたが、普段と違うからこそ\n引き立つというお話は、得心がいきました。", "zh": "原来如此……虽然是第一次听说，不过正因为与平时不同，才能更加突出，这个说法我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "791e80b55590a84cf237b118c658d2e06a5780c0669f2ab31b91897a985e6361", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nおかげさまで、気分も落ち着いてまいりました。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n多亏了您，我的心情也逐渐平静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1b881fc0f0be1ba659e170d749d8d4f1ec241a63d08301e194afa6624b3a38d2", "ja": "よかった。それじゃ、今度の公演がお披露目本番だ。\n楽しみにしていてくれよ！", "zh": "太好了。那么，下次的公演就是正式亮相了。\n好好期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "53976956e0d0f47dc06190d2bbca020687d6bf7ff5edafe3fe350b37e6979e35", "ja": "はい。この上は、違うことを恐れずに。\nどんどんぎゃっぷ萌えしていただきたく思います。", "zh": "是的。既然到了这一步，还请不要害怕展现不同的一面。希望大家能尽情感受反差萌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "a1badd8aa95b6a14e6eab44f12deee5c44d52d295ad7467157c42dfe05c29a9d", "ja": "ぶろぐにこめんとをくださった、\nたくさんのファンの皆様に。ですが……。", "zh": "致在博客上留言的众多粉丝们。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0174_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "8fe29f1ab7fb0866269b49d88b6b5c6e505e3b87cec20cff23be6e4b056e5779", "ja": "その、せっかくですから、最初は……\nあなた様。ぎゃっぷ萌え……していただけますか？", "zh": "那个，难得有这个机会，先……您能感受一下反差萌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
